    {
      "id": "claim_9ba5128d1df24637ad85e393c8eee77e",
      "statement": "The service-role Supabase client (getServiceRoleClient/createServiceRoleClient) is created with SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, bypasses RLS, is used by server code to mutate game state, and throws if constructed in a browser context (window defined) or when its required env vars are missing.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/supabase/server.ts#L1-L40",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3d5a27b15f8783e34adb1b7e2bb89212a1bb03ab08ee1663a7fc6945f0e9117a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3eaf1d9140c244a1801552758bd0ff42",
      "statement": "The browser Supabase client (getBrowserSupabaseClient) is a client-only module created with the public anon key (NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY) and never holds the service-role key, so browser requests are subject to RLS.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/supabase/browser.ts#L1-L30",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5793a94c48f669042e2f480febdaeab27496de78c613e2bb2e5430629303afac:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7e888ed6b4ee46f686e1f2771227c6ba",
      "statement": "The service-role client module enforces a server-only import boundary by importing lib/supabase/server-only.ts, which imports the 'server-only' package, causing a build-time error if the service-role client is pulled into a client bundle.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://lib/supabase/server-only.ts#L1-L3",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ecfae5b7e57327e8943aae8d9072fb24ce5df64557f69b7c15b098e477adcfeb:"
