      "id": "claim_687abddff69b4b429e0d3fdf079ffc37",
      "statement": "Rate limiting can be disabled per scope: RATE_LIMIT_DISABLE_ALL (alias RATE_LIMIT_BYPASS) bypasses every scope when truthy, and RATE_LIMIT_DISABLED_SCOPES is a comma-separated list of individually disabled scopes; a bypassed scope short-circuits and returns a full snapshot without touching the store.",
