      "statement": "resolveClientIp derives an IP identifier for IP-based rate-limit scopes by checking forwarded-for and proxy headers in a fixed priority order (x-forwarded-for, x-real-ip, cf-connecting-ip, true-client-ip, x-client-ip, fastly-client-ip, x-cluster-client-ip), taking the first address, and returning 'unknown' when none match.",
